351 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 154 0 R
/E (Network no-show rate exceeds the 15% reduction target, with 904 missed appointments out of 5,000. Friday is highest risk day \(20.9%\), Wednesday lowest \(15.8%\).)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
352 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 154 0 R
